*.log

# Runtime state a running hub writes beside itself, at the default paths
# in rrc-hub.example.toml. peers.toml is the one that matters: it holds
# real users' public keys, nicknames and any mentions still waiting for
# them, and it appears the first time anybody connects.
/peers.toml
/rooms.toml
/klines.txt
/history/

